    "detailed_description": "Clunky has never seen the sunset hiding behind the mountain, but it's too high to climb. <br>Help him make his way through the tunnel where great dangers lingers...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100010/extras/ca25b166844391c21ece9c5df7e7ab7e.avif?t=1717841988\" /></div><br><br>Breakthrough is a fast paced roguelike-shooter with high-risk high-rewards mechanics.<br>With a very high difficulty, it is designed for thoses seeking a great challenge.<br><br>You will loot plenty of items and projectiles and there is always action to take to balance out the occasional bad luck.<br>Gambling your items for better ones, buying stuff at the shop, and rigourously upgrading your spells, will help you create the perfect build to overcome the hurdle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100010/extras/138135907bf926c4d58a70d8b7a3dd23.avif?t=1717841988\" /></div><br><br>In this game you will find:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    3 Bosses awaiting to crush you<br></li><li>    5 level of progression<br></li><li>    Bullet-hell gameplay<br></li><li>    Monsters running at you<br></li><li>    Dashes to dodge them<br></li><li>    Fast loading time<br></li><li>    Speedrun friendly (runs history, save your favorites)</li></ul>",
